WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Okay!

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.233
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:11.833
A.

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:12.467
Dog,

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:13.067
B.

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:13.667
Cow,

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:14.267
C.

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:14.900
Pencil,

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.100
or D.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:16.700
Cat?

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.933
Five seconds!

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.900
TIME'S UP!

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:26.933
The answer is...

00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:27.400
C,

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:27.867
pencil!

00:00:27.867 --> 00:00:28.767
A dog,

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:29.233
cat,

00:00:29.233 --> 00:00:31.067
and cow are animals.

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:33.367
A pencil is not alive,

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:35.633
so it does not belong.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:37.833
Here's one,

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:39.367
a picture puzzle!

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:41.900
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:42.400
A.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.933
An empty triangle,

00:00:43.933 --> 00:00:44.467
B.

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:46.000
An empty square,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:46.500
C.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.033
A filled square,

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:49.033
or D.

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:50.567
A filled circle?

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:51.600
Five seconds!

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.600
TIME'S UP!

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:00.433
The answer is...

00:01:00.433 --> 00:01:00.833
D,

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:02.000
a filled circle!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.367
The rule is the shape gets

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:06.700
filled in but stays the same

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.100
shape,

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.433
so the empty circle becomes a

00:01:09.433 --> 00:01:10.233
filled circle.

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:12.667
Here's one,

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:14.633
a number series!

00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:15.267
Two,

00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:15.933
six,

00:01:15.933 --> 00:01:16.600
eight,

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:17.233
fourteen,

00:01:17.233 --> 00:01:17.900
twenty-two,

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:19.200
and then...

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.167
what comes next?

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:21.800
A.

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.467
Thirty-eight,

00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:23.100
B.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:23.767
Thirty-six,

00:01:23.767 --> 00:01:24.400
C.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:25.067
Thirty-five,

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:26.367
or D.

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:27.033
Thirty-one?

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:28.333
Five seconds!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.300
TIME'S UP!

00:01:35.967 --> 00:01:37.467
The answer is...

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:37.967
B,

00:01:37.967 --> 00:01:38.467
thirty-six!

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:41.467
Add the two numbers before it:

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.967
twenty-two plus fourteen is thirty-six.

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:45.533
So,

00:01:45.533 --> 00:01:47.567
are you smart or fart?

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:50.000
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.200
find your rank!

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:52.700
So,

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.100
how did you do?

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.467
Comment your score below,

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:56.833
and follow for more!
